{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "_cache = {}\n\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the nth number of the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n - P(n-1)) for n > 2, with P(1)=1, P(2)=1.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n in _cache:\n        return _cache[n]\n\n    if n == 1 or n == 2:\n        _cache[n] = 1\n        return 1\n\n    p_n_minus_1 = sequence(n - 1)\n    result = sequence(p_n_minus_1) + sequence(n - p_n_minus_1)\n    _cache[n] = result\n    return result"}
