{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "def validate(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks whether the frequency of each digit in the integer 'number'\n    is less than or equal to the digit itself.\n    \"\"\"\n    s_number = str(number)\n    digit_counts = {}\n    for char_digit in s_number:\n        digit_counts[char_digit] = digit_counts.get(char_digit, 0) + 1\n\n    for char_digit, count in digit_counts.items():\n        digit_value = int(char_digit)\n        if count > digit_value:\n            return False\n    return True"}
