{"task_id": "Mbpp/290", "solution": "def max_length(list_of_lists):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sub-list with the maximum length in a list of lists.\n    Returns (0, []) if the input list_of_lists is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not list_of_lists:\n        return (0, [])\n\n    max_length_found = 0\n    max_list_found = []\n\n    for current_list in list_of_lists:\n        current_list_length = len(current_list)\n        if current_list_length > max_length_found:\n            max_length_found = current_list_length\n            max_list_found = current_list\n\n    return (max_length_found, max_list_found)"}
