{"task_id": "Mbpp/392", "solution": "def get_max_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum sum for an integer n using a recursive formula with memoization.\n    f(n) = max( (f(n/2) + f(n/3) + f(n/4) + f(n/5)), n)\n    \"\"\"\n    memo = {}\n\n    def _calculate_recursive(current_n: int) -> int:\n        if current_n == 0:\n            return 0\n        if current_n in memo:\n            return memo[current_n]\n\n        sum_of_parts = (_calculate_recursive(current_n // 2) +\n                        _calculate_recursive(current_n // 3) +\n                        _calculate_recursive(current_n // 4) +\n                        _calculate_recursive(current_n // 5))\n\n        result = max(sum_of_parts, current_n)\n        memo[current_n] = result\n        return result\n\n    return _calculate_recursive(n)"}
