{"task_id": "Mbpp/409", "solution": "def min_product_tuple(list_of_tuples: list[tuple[int, int]]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the minimum product from pairs of integers within a given list of tuples.\n    Calculates the product for each tuple and returns the overall minimum.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_product = float('inf')  # Initialize min_product to a very large number\n\n    for item1, item2 in list_of_tuples:\n        current_product = item1 * item2\n        if current_product < min_product:\n            min_product = current_product\n\n    return min_product"}
