{"task_id": "Mbpp/418", "solution": "def Find_Max(input_list):\n    \"\"\"Finds the element (sub-list) of a list having maximum length.\n    Returns None if the input_list is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return None\n\n    max_element = None\n    max_length = -1\n\n    for sub_list in input_list:\n        current_length = len(sub_list)\n        if current_length > max_length:\n            max_length = current_length\n            max_element = sub_list\n\n    return max_element"}
