{"task_id": "Mbpp/432", "solution": "def median_trapezium(side1: float, side2: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the median length of a trapezium given its two parallel sides.\n    The median length is the average of the two parallel sides.\n    \"\"\"\n    class Trapezium:\n        \"\"\"\n        Encapsulates trapezium properties and median length calculation.\n        \"\"\"\n        def __init__(self, side1: float, side2: float):\n            self._parallel_side1 = side1\n            self._parallel_side2 = side2\n\n        def calculate_median_length(self) -> float:\n            \"\"\"\n            Calculates and returns the median length.\n            \"\"\"\n            return (self._parallel_side1 + self._parallel_side2) / 2.0\n\n    trapezium_obj = Trapezium(side1, side2)\n    return trapezium_obj.calculate_median_length()"}
