{"task_id": "Mbpp/576", "solution": "def is_Sub_Array(main_list: list, sub_list: list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if 'sub_list' is a contiguous sublist of 'main_list'.\n\n    Args:\n        main_list: The list to be searched.\n        sub_list: The potential sublist to find.\n\n    Returns:\n        True if sub_list is a contiguous sublist of main_list, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not sub_list:\n        return True\n\n    if len(sub_list) > len(main_list):\n        return False\n\n    for i in range(len(main_list) - len(sub_list) + 1):\n        if main_list[i : i + len(sub_list)] == sub_list:\n            return True\n    return False"}
