{"task_id": "Mbpp/803", "solution": "def is_perfect_square(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a given integer is a perfect square.\"\"\"\n    if number < 0:\n        return False\n    if number == 0:\n        return True\n    \n    # Calculate the integer square root\n    sqrt_num = int(number**0.5)\n    # Check if squaring the integer square root yields the original number\n    return sqrt_num * sqrt_num == number"}
